# Shipping a Mote version

Pushing `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` starts the Release workflow. Pushing `main` does **not**.

```sh
git tag vX.Y.Z
git push origin vX.Y.Z
gh run watch
```

Do not stop until the GitHub Release has **`Mote-X.Y.Z.dmg` and `Mote-X.Y.Z.zip`**. The two “Source code” archives GitHub adds to a tag are not a build.

If the tag is already on origin and no run started, dispatch:

```sh
gh workflow run Release --field channel=stable --field version=X.Y.Z
```

Beta tags: `vX.Y.Z-beta.N`. Secrets `SIGNING_P12_*` must exist or the run fails at import.

Full recipe: [docs/release.md](docs/release.md).
